<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:51:14 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>霜冻报告再袭</title><link>https://some.pics/6b01a1ceed559</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《弗罗斯特报告》。#弗罗斯特又来了！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="frosty grass with moss etc.	" height="2249" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jvk/6b01a1ceed559.jpg" width="2999"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jvk.some.pics"&gt;@jvk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:51:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>无晴转微阳</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018eac6048a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;没有太阳，一点太阳，太阳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A circular, rounded, black bin lid, photographed from above, stands on frosty, snow-covered ground. A clearly visible pattern of frost and snow can be seen on it. The left-hand side is covered with a thick layer of white snow; in the centre, a thin, wedge-shaped layer of frost stretches across; and on the right-hand side, a glossy black surface is visible with scattered patches of moisture." height="2686" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6b018eac6048a.jpg" width="2686"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:29:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纪伊国屋书店</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018c9bb8046</link><description>&lt;p&gt;纪伊国屋&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="kinokuniya" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/heymarvic/6b018c9bb8046.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://heymarvic.some.pics"&gt;@heymarvic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:20:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>海湾大桥</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018c44740a9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;海湾大桥&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bay Bridge" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/heymarvic/6b018c44740a9.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://heymarvic.some.pics"&gt;@heymarvic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:19:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纪念2026年Langreo地理营的礼物</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018b1612700</link><description>&lt;p&gt;来自@michogar@masto.es的一份礼物，用来纪念2026年在Langreo举办的#geocampes，那里正处于矿区山谷之中。谢谢！！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Una foto de los tres volúmenes de la trilogía minera de Aitana Castaño" height="2784" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jsanz/6b018b1612700.jpg" width="3447"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jsanz.some.pics"&gt;@jsanz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:14:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>核桃溪</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018a8a20ee5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;核桃溪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Walnut Creek " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/heymarvic/6b018a8a20ee5.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://heymarvic.some.pics"&gt;@heymarvic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:11:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>可可海滩</title><link>https://some.pics/6b018a5493d16</link><description>&lt;p&gt;可可海滩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Coco Beach" height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/heymarvic/6b018a5493d16.jpg" width="2048"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://heymarvic.some.pics"&gt;@heymarvic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:11:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>旧金山渡轮大厦</title><link>https://some.pics/6b0188773aa89</link><description>&lt;p&gt;旧金山渡轮大厦&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="San Francisco Ferry Building" height="3024" referrerpo